<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2891_11363.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Woledler, Gestreng unnd Vest, Ehnvest, Fuernem, Fuersichtig
<lb n="2"/>Ersam unnd weiße, großguenstige hochgeehrte <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Herren</unclear>,
<lb n="3"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-56" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Herrn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hauptman</unclear> Burgermaister unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rathe</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dißer</unclear>
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">loebl</unclear>: Statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Costanz</unclear></orgName>.
<lb n="5"/>Nachdem der Edel Ehnvest, unnd hochgelehrt Herr Dr
<lb n="6"/>Canzleijverwalter mich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gestriges</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abents</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gueetig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">be=</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">richtet</unclear>, daß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ewer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">G</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Estrl</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ehnvest</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wht</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bedacht</unclear>
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seie</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Durchleuchtigisten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hochgebornen</unclear>
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fuersten</unclear> unnd Herrn, <persName resp="#ner">Herrn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Leopoldum</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Erzherzogen</unclear>
<lb n="10"/>zue <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-91" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Osterreich</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etc</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">meinen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gdigsten</unclear> Herrn, auf begehren
<lb n="11"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Herrn Burgermaister unnd Rath <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> St: Gallen</orgName>, ein
<lb n="12"/>exemplar meines iungst in Truckh verfertigten
<lb n="13"/>Tractaetleins zueubersenden, unnd Ihr Frstl: Dchlt
<lb n="14"/>gnedigst erkennen lassen, ob <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daßselbige</unclear> (<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eß</unclear> die
<lb n="15"/>ermelte von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">St: Gallen</placeName> gern tituliren woelten) fuer
<lb n="16"/>famos zueachten seije, oder aber nit. Wie dann Herr
<lb n="17"/>Canzleijverwalter zue solchem End ein Exemplar
<lb n="18"/>abgefordert.
<lb n="19"/>Unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wiewohl</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> Herrn ich daßselbig gern, unnd
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohne</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bedenckhen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuegestelt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besorg</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eß</unclear> daß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ansehen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ge=</unclear>
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">winnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moechte</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hete</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiemit</unclear> in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solchen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">St</unclear>:
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gallischen</unclear> modum wider mich zue procediren wol=
<lb n="23"/>bedachtlig consentirt. Wan nun aber ich in meinem
<lb n="24"/>uber nacht mit mir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">selbs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gehabten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rathschlag</unclear> be=
<lb n="25"/>funden, daß ich hiedurch an meinen Rechten in vil weg
<lb n="26"/>verkuezert, unnd merckhlich beschwert wurde, So
<lb n="27"/>hab ich nit koenen umbgehen, vor E: G: Estrk: und
<lb n="28"/>Eht: W: meiner <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrungen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hohen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Noturfft</unclear> nach, mich
<lb n="29"/>in bester form protestando zueerklaern, daß ich meines
<lb n="30"/>thaillß hierein kaineß wegs woll consentirt haben,
<lb n="31"/>noch consentieren koenne. Dann dieweil (wie
<lb n="32"/>ichs entlich darfuer halte) mein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Tractaetlein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sach</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ist</unclear>,
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">welches</unclear> von der Kaijl: mir ertheilten comission herfle=
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2891_11364.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="34"/>gestaltn dependirt, unnd daran hangt, daß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diße</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fueglich</unclear>
<lb n="35"/>von der selbign nit khuenen separirt werden, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sintemahlen</unclear>
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anderß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nichts</unclear> ist, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ains</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thailß</unclear> ain <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">defension</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear>
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schutzschrifft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ihr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Kaiß</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mt</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">selbsten</unclear>, so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nemblich</unclear>
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">commission</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rechtmessig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolgegruendet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seÿe</unclear>,
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thails</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aber</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nur</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erzoehlung</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">warumb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Kaißl</unclear>.
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">huelff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anzuerueffn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">genoettiget</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wordn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seÿe</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wellch</unclear>
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gestalt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nun</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ablainung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">St</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gallerischen</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">denn</unclear>
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Herren</unclear> <orgName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eÿdtgnoßn</unclear></orgName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschehenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unbegruendtn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuerbringens</unclear>,
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuerbringen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">habn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khuenen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geliebt</unclear>,
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dargegn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">meinthwegn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">niemandt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geredt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">so</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khann</unclear>
<lb n="45"/>ich nit gedenckhn, daß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dißer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">St</unclear><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gallerische</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">modus</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ge</unclear>-
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">billichet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werdn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khuene</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dieweÿl</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ansehen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hat</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear>
<lb n="47"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">suochen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">forum</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">declinieren</unclear>, unnd fuer die <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Eÿdtgn.</orgName>
<lb n="48"/>Ght. zu ziehen, waß meins bedunckhns fuer Ihr Mt.
<lb n="49"/>unnd dero wolverordnetn commissarium gehoerig were.
<lb n="50"/>Damiten aber ihnen noch villweniger zuewillfahren, die-
<lb n="51"/>weÿl sie den Kaißer in aller underthenigkait auß-
<lb n="52"/>bittung der confirmation ihrer freÿhaitn, unnd alß in
<lb n="53"/>gnadnsachn wolt juengst, alß superiorem erkhenndt: dero-
<lb n="54"/>wegn sie in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">justizi</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sachn</unclear> billich auch daselbst hin zue-
<lb n="55"/>weißn sein, unnd dieweil die Herren von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">St. Gallen</placeName>
<lb n="56"/>nebens dem auch furnemblich suochen, wie sie denn
<lb n="57"/>salvum conductum schwachn khuendtn, zum weinigstn so
<lb n="58"/>weit, daß ich allhie kainen plaz mehr habn sollt. Weil
<lb n="59"/>aber Ihr Kaißl. Mt. in ihrem an Ihr Eÿdtg. Ght fuer
<lb n="60"/>mich unnderm dato <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-15" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Wienn</placeName>, <date resp="#ner">24. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Martÿ</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ao</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">1631</unclear></date>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">be</unclear>-
<lb n="61"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">willigtem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">recommendationschribn</unclear> an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dißelb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnedigclich</unclear>
<lb n="62"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begeren</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beÿ</unclear> dem salvo conductu, da ich darwider an-
<lb n="63"/>gefochtn werdn solte, in Ihr Mt. namen mich zue handt-
<lb n="64"/>habn unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schuezn</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">So</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gibe</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mein</unclear>
<lb n="65"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Khuecheln</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ain</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">famosschrifft</unclear> sein, mit ordentlichen rechten
<lb n="66"/>noch nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uberwundn</unclear> bin. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ihr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eÿdtg</unclear>.
<lb n="67"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ght</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ainer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solchn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erclärung</unclear>, allain auß deß
<lb n="68"/>ainen thailß ungestuemeß anhaltn disponirt werdn solte.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2891_11365.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="69"/>in mehr weg zum hoechsten beschwaerlich fallen wurde. So achte
<lb n="70"/>ich die nicht unerthebliche gruend fuer den kays. commissarium
<lb n="71"/>zueweißen seyn. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Insonderheit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermoeg</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kays</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mt</unclear>.
<lb n="72"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnderm</unclear> dato <date resp="#ner">12. septembris verruckt 1631</date> jahrs dem
<lb n="73"/>kays. herrn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">commissario</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuegesandter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fehrnerer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erklaerung</unclear>,
